Appending a value that is already in the list is a no-op; running the same
append twice produces a diff only on the first invocation.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Test Plan
tags:
- a
---
# Body

-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append tags=b
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append tags=b
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 title: Test Plan
 tags:
 - a
+- b
 ---
 # Body
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: tags+=b
updated plan.md: tags+=b
